+| 0x1000 | W | 0 or 1 (gate) | 0x402b0528, 0x402b0c70, 0x402b0300 |
+| 0x1100 | RW | [6:0] plus bit 9 (unit 0) or bit 8 (unit 1); mask 0xFFFFC080 | 0x402b0300: unit 0 at 0x402b03b4/0x402b03c8 (bit 9), unit 1 at 0x402b03d0/0x402b03e4 (bit 8) |
+| 0x1104 | RW | same shape, unit 1 only | 0x402b0300 (0x402b03e8) |
+| 0x1200 | RW | 1 / 17 / `&= ~3`, `\| (flag << 8)` | 0x402b0814, 0x402b0a24 |
