+0x402b0528 / 0x402b0c70 take a 16-bit sub-block selector and the bit → target
+mapping is itself evidence of the layout:
+
+```
+bit 0    -> window0 + 0x0000          bit 5    -> 0x1548E100
+bit 1    -> window0 + 0x2000          bit 6    -> 0x1548F000
+bit 2    -> window0 + 0x3000          bit 7    -> 0x15491000
+bits 3|4 -> window0 + 0x1000          bit 8    -> 0x15492000
