+Everything else in these windows is reached as `base + runtime offset`
+(0x402b64bc, 0x402b4f38), so the model is a plain register file over each
+0x4000 window, in the idiom the board already uses for the EMIO and VPIPE
+banks. **No register in these windows is claimed to mean anything beyond the
+table above.**
