+Window 2 (0x15C80000 / 0x15C84000) is the same shape — four 0x1000
+sub-blocks, dispatcher indices 14..17 — but **no offset in it is established
+at all**: nothing writes it through a constant and the only reader is the
+generic dispatcher. It is outside the 0x15400000–0x15700000 band this work
+covers; the header defines it and the wiring note leaves the decision to map
+it to the integrator.
