+access that is not an aligned 32-bit one, stops the VM with the offending
+address and PC. That includes the large holes: 0x15496000: 0x000–0x06C, 0x074–0x088, 0x098–0x0AC, 0x0B4–0x13C,
+0x144–0x14C, 0x154–0x21C, 0x224–0x240, 0x248–0x24C, 0x254–0x260,
