+## Derived from the Z 8 build
+
+`../n-research/analysis/Z6III_0200/reports/z8_to_z63_function_map.json` holds
+246 more, matched from the Z 8 image where each address carries a label from
+z8-qemu's harness — things like "original Card HAL complete phase-3
+constructor". Measured precision is 94.8% against held-out string references,
+and 233 of the 246 also pass a local-delta consistency check. Treat an entry
+as a lead, not a fact, until something confirms it: a wrong one fails loudly
+because the harness asserts each call's return value. Method and numbers are
+in `../n-research/scripts/z63-port/README.md`.
